# =============================================================================
# .gitleaksignore — false positive suppression for Gitleaks
# =============================================================================
#
# Each line is a Gitleaks fingerprint (commit:file:rule:line hash) for a
# specific finding that has been reviewed and confirmed as a false positive.
#
# To add a new entry:
#   1. Run gitleaks locally: gitleaks detect --verbose
#   2. Copy the Fingerprint value from the finding
#   3. Add it here with a comment explaining why it is safe
#
# Review this file periodically to remove entries for deleted code.
# =============================================================================

